SUBJECTS.P:
On7 July 1995the Commission, having on21 June 1995obtained a favourable opinion from the Staff Regulations Committee in accordance with the second paragraph of Article 10 of the Staff Regulations of officials of the European Communities (
        the Staff Regulations
        ), presented a proposal for a Council Regulation (EC, Euratom, ECSC) introducing special measures to terminate the service of officials of the European Communities as a result of the accession of Austria, Sweden and Finland (COM (95) 327 final,OJ 1995 C 246, p. 23, hereinafter
        the initial proposal
        )

The initial proposal was submitted to the institutions concerned for their opinion, in accordance with Article 24 of the Treaty establishing a Single Council and a Single Commission of the European Communities (
        the Merger Treaty
        ).
